        "original_id": "5ec8f4fa-8fea-55fb-9652-e3f5b1f587b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kool Kojak, Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse and Joy, Andy Milonakis, Danny DeVito, Ed Helms, Zac Efron, Savan Kotecha, Victoria Justice, Icona Pop, Warren G\n- Works: Dr. Seuss's The Lorax, The Lorax (film), Best Friend's Brother, Victorious\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n\nFacts:\n- Kool Kojak has written and produced for artists including Sean Paul, Yelle, Waka Flocka Flame, Travis Barker, Britney Spears, Jesse and Joy, Andy Milonakis, Icona Pop, N.A.S.A., Dirt Nasty, Lordz of Brooklyn, Ursula 1000, and Warren G.\n- Kool Kojak has also written and produced for Dr. Seuss's The Lorax.\n- In The Lorax film, Danny DeVito plays the Lorax, Ed Helms plays the Once-ler, and Zac Efron plays Ted.\n- Best Friend's Brother was produced by Kool Kojak.\n- Kool Kojak, Savan Kotecha, and Victoria Justice co-wrote Best Friend's Brother.\n- Best Friend's Brother was created for the 2011 soundtrack to the Nickelodeon television series Victorious.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
